Description: guitar tablature and score viewer
 OxiGuitar opens Guitar Pro files (.gp, .gpx, .gp5, .gp4, .gp3) and
 shows them as standard notation and tablature in four layouts, with any
 set of tracks together, and exports them to PDF. Editing and playback
 follow in later versions. No telemetry: it never uploads anything.
 .
 OxiGuitar reads files only through format plugins; the package
 oxiguitar-plugins-basic holds those for Guitar Pro files.

Package: oxiguitar-plugins-basic
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Enhances:
 oxiguitar,
Description: Guitar Pro format plugins for OxiGuitar
 The plugins the OxiGuitar project writes and recommends: one for each
 Guitar Pro format (3, 4, 5, 6 and 7-8), so OxiGuitar can open those
 files. OxiGuitar alone opens no file; it finds these in
 /usr/lib/oxiguitar/plugins.
